  "description": "A massive asteroid is about to hit earth! \n\nHumanity has failed to stop a giant asteroid from plummeting into Earth, and life as we know it has ended. An ordinary Korean office worker named Cheol-Su is somehow given the chance to go back in time and prevent this catastrophe from ever happening. Does he have a chance? \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
